{"id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-assignment.md","title":"Variable Assignment","display":"df-assignment — Variable Assignment","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-assignment","aliases":["58-df-assignment","Variable Assignment","Valuation"],"display":"df-assignment — Variable Assignment","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-assignment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-assignment</span><span>Variable Assignment</span><span>Valuation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-assignment — Variable Assignment"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,\\mathcal M\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L,\\mathcal M\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in V\">\\(s\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M))\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M))\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\,\\cdot\\,)[\\,\\cdot\\mapsto\\cdot\\,]:V\\times\\mathrm{Var}_S\\times\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\to V\">\\((\\,\\cdot\\,)[\\,\\cdot\\mapsto\\cdot\\,]:V\\times\\mathrm{Var}_S\\times\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\to V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}assignment\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal{M},s)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal{M}))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}assignment\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal{M},s)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal{M}))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}assignment\\text{-}update} \\vdash s[x\\mapsto a]\\coloneqq\\left(s\\upharpoonright(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\{x\\})\\right)\\cup\\{\\langle x,a\\rangle\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}assignment\\text{-}update} \\vdash s[x\\mapsto a]\\coloneqq\\left(s\\upharpoonright(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\{x\\})\\right)\\cup\\{\\langle x,a\\rangle\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}assignment\\text{-}update\\text{-}closure} \\vdash \\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal{M},s)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal{M}) \\to \\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal{M},s[x\\mapsto a])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}assignment\\text{-}update\\text{-}closure} \\vdash \\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal{M},s)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal{M}) \\to \\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal{M},s[x\\mapsto a])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}assignment\\text{-}update\\text{-}at} \\vdash \\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal{M},s)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\to(s[x\\mapsto a])(x)=a\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}assignment\\text{-}update\\text{-}at} \\vdash \\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal{M},s)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\to(s[x\\mapsto a])(x)=a\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}assignment\\text{-}update\\text{-}off} \\vdash \\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal{M},s)\\land x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land y\\neq x\\to(s[x\\mapsto a])(y)=s(y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}assignment\\text{-}update\\text{-}off} \\vdash \\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal{M},s)\\land x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land y\\neq x\\to(s[x\\mapsto a])(y)=s(y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(v_n) = a_n\">\\(s(v_n) = a_n\\)</span> 表示变元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_n\">\\(v_n\\)</span> 被赋予值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_n\">\\(a_n\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal{M},s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal{M},s)\\)</span> says that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> maps every variable into the universe of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}\">\\(\\mathcal{M}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[x\\mapsto a]\">\\(s[x\\mapsto a]\\)</span> modifies only the value assigned to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><code>Assign</code> now requires its first argument to be a structure, and the update notation is typed as a ternary operation including the assignment being updated.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hodges, A Shorter Model Theory, §1.2</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","t